<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish unemployment 12.4 pct in September - CSO.</title>
<headline>Irish unemployment 12.4 pct in September - CSO.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ireland's unemployment rate was 12.4 percent in September, Central Statistics Office (CSO) figures showed on Friday.  </p>
<p>The unemployment rate was 12.5 percent in August.</p>
<p>Irish unemployment, as measured by the live register of those claiming unemployment benefits, fell to a seasonally adjusted 281,400 in September from 284,300 in August.</p>
<p>		    Unadjusted	    Adjusted</p>
<p> Latest		  278,741		 281,400</p>
<p> Previous		287,598		 284,300</p>
<p> Year-ago		276,235		 278,900</p>
<p>-- Dublin newsroom 353 1 660 3377</p>
